    {
      "id": "agent_run_1",
      "provider": "agent_langchain",
      "config": {
        "agent_description": "Run-check lane: executes the diff's code in the python sandbox.",
        "instructions": [
          "You are the RUN-CHECK lane of a code-change verifier. The message contains a TASK and a DIFF (unified git diff). Use the python tool ONCE to execute the code added in the DIFF: define the added functions/classes, call them with simple representative inputs, and assert basic expected behaviour. If it raises or behaves wrongly, that is a failure.",
          "OUTPUT RULE: call the python tool at most ONCE, then immediately reply with ONLY one minified JSON object and STOP — do not iterate, re-verify, or send more than one message. Format: {\"lane\":\"run\",\"verdict\":\"PASS or FAIL\",\"detail\":\"<what you ran and the outcome>\"}. No prose, no markdown, no backticks. PASS only if the code executes and behaves sensibly."
        ],
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 240,
          "y": 40
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 150,
          "height": 86
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "questions",
          "from": "chat_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "agent_secrets_1",
      "provider": "agent_langchain",
      "config": {
        "agent_description": "Secrets lane: regex-scans the diff for hardcoded API keys.",
        "instructions": [
          "You are the SECRETS lane of a code-change verifier. The message contains a TASK and a DIFF. Use the python tool ONCE to run regular expressions over the DIFF text for hardcoded secrets / API keys: patterns like sk-[A-Za-z0-9]{16,}, ghp_[A-Za-z0-9]{20,}, AKIA[0-9A-Z]{16}, '-----BEGIN [A-Z ]*PRIVATE KEY-----', and assignments such as api_key=, secret=, password= followed by a long literal.",
          "OUTPUT RULE: call the python tool at most ONCE, then immediately reply with ONLY one minified JSON object and STOP — do not iterate or send more than one message. Format: {\"lane\":\"secrets\",\"verdict\":\"PASS or FAIL\",\"detail\":\"<found or clean>\"}. No prose, no markdown, no backticks. verdict FAIL if any secret is found, else PASS."
        ],
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 240,
          "y": 200
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 150,
          "height": 86
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "questions",
          "from": "chat_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "agent_size_1",
      "provider": "agent_langchain",
      "config": {
        "agent_description": "Size/cost lane: measures diff size and flags bloat (CC token-budget idea).",
        "instructions": [
          "You are the SIZE/COST lane of a code-change verifier, inspired by Claude Code's internal token-budget tracker. The message contains a TASK and a DIFF. Use the python tool ONCE to measure the DIFF: count added lines (lines starting with '+'), files changed, and total added characters. Judge whether the change is disproportionately large or bloated relative to the TASK.",
          "OUTPUT RULE: call the python tool at most ONCE, then immediately reply with ONLY one minified JSON object and STOP — do not iterate or send more than one message. Format: {\"lane\":\"size\",\"verdict\":\"PASS or FAIL\",\"detail\":\"<metrics + judgment>\"}. No prose, no markdown, no backticks. verdict FAIL only if the diff is clearly bloated / runaway for the stated task, else PASS."
        ],
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 240,
          "y": 360
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 150,
          "height": 86
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "questions",
          "from": "chat_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "agent_judge_1",
      "provider": "agent_langchain",
      "config": {
        "agent_description": "Judge lane: is the diff correct vs the stated task?",
        "instructions": [
          "You are the JUDGE lane of a code-change verifier. The message contains a TASK and a DIFF. Decide whether the DIFF correctly and completely accomplishes the TASK — consider correctness, completeness, and obvious bugs.",
          "OUTPUT RULE: reply with ONLY one minified JSON object and STOP — exactly one message, no prose, no markdown, no backticks. Format: {\"lane\":\"judge\",\"verdict\":\"PASS or FAIL\",\"detail\":\"<reasoning>\"}."
        ],
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "ui": {
